  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-ba4d90e2b2f1447a2ab89e88",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "假设前置滤波器设计良好，使得频率大于 ω_s/2 的噪声几乎不产生混叠，则采样率的选择基本遵循与跟踪有效性相同的经验法则；即采样率通常在 ω_BW 的 25 倍或更高数量级。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Assuming the prefilter is well designed so that there is little or no aliasing of noise with a frequency greater than ω_s/2, the sample rate selection pretty much follows the same rule of thumb as Tracking Effectiveness; that is, sample rates on the order of 25 times ω_BW or higher are typical.",
